# J.S. Bach -- Prelude No. 1 in C major, BWV 846 (Das wohltemperierte Klavier I)
# Public domain. Bars 1-12 as written, plus a closing tonic bar added to end
# the excerpt; no other change.
#
# Every bar is the same eight-sixteenth figure played twice: two low notes,
# then a three-note shape repeated. Bach wrote an arpeggio study, which makes
# this the single best piece in the book for hearing what a chip arpeggio
# voice is FOR -- the whole prelude is one channel cycling a chord, which is
# the technique the NES was built around 250 years later.

@track prelude-c
  name   PRELUDE IN C
  bpm    68
  beats  16
  era    16bit
  tags   classical bach public-domain

@note The figure is [bass] [tenor] [a b c] [a b c], twice per bar.

@voice right inst=piano mix=0.17 pan=-0.08
  c3  e3  g3  c4  e4  g3  c4  e4   c3  e3  g3  c4  e4  g3  c4  e4
  c3  d3  a3  d4  f4  a3  d4  f4   c3  d3  a3  d4  f4  a3  d4  f4
  b2  d3  g3  d4  f4  g3  d4  f4   b2  d3  g3  d4  f4  g3  d4  f4
  c3  e3  g3  c4  e4  g3  c4  e4   c3  e3  g3  c4  e4  g3  c4  e4
  c3  e3  a3  e4  a4  a3  e4  a4   c3  e3  a3  e4  a4  a3  e4  a4
  c3  d3  f#3 a3  d4  f#3 a3  d4   c3  d3  f#3 a3  d4  f#3 a3  d4
  b2  d3  g3  d4  g4  g3  d4  g4   b2  d3  g3  d4  g4  g3  d4  g4
  b2  c3  e3  g3  c4  e3  g3  c4   b2  c3  e3  g3  c4  e3  g3  c4
  a2  c3  e3  g3  c4  e3  g3  c4   a2  c3  e3  g3  c4  e3  g3  c4
  d2  a2  d3  f#3 c4  d3  f#3 c4   d2  a2  d3  f#3 c4  d3  f#3 c4
  g2  b2  d3  g3  b3  d3  g3  b3   g2  b2  d3  g3  b3  d3  g3  b3
  g2  b2  f3  g3  b3  f3  g3  b3   g2  b2  f3  g3  b3  f3  g3  b3
  c3  e3  g3  c4  e4  g3  c4  e4   c3  e3  g3  c4  e4  g3  c4  e4

# The pedal note under it. Bach does not write this; a chip arrangement wants
# it, because a piano's sustain does the job of holding the harmony and a
# 16-voice synth has no pedal.
@voice pedal inst=pad mix=0.055 oct=-1 pan=0.1
  c3  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  c3  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  b2  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  c3  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  c3  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  c3  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  b2  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  b2  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  a2  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  d2  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  g2  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
  g2  .   .   .   .   .   .   .    .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
